<!-- 9. GUARANTEE + CLOSE -->
<h2>The bit that made it a low-stakes decision</h2>

<p><mark>[XX]</mark> days, box open, used.</p>

<p>That mattered because the honest timeline here is six to eight weeks — that is how long skin takes to turn over and nothing shortens it. A thirty-day window on something that takes eight weeks to judge is not a guarantee, it is a technicality.</p>

<p>Nothing goes back in the post. No form asking you to prove it did not work.</p>

<p>So the only thing you are actually out is eight weeks of two nights a week.</p>

